Redrob Launcher
Redrob Launcher is an app hub for Redrob products derived from ArtCraft Launcher
(https://github.com/storytold/craft-launcher). It is a rebranded and extended
distribution of that work; files taken from upstream keep their license, and
the full license texts are retained in LICENSE-MIT and LICENSE-APACHE.
Modifications and Redrob Launcher branding:
Copyright (c) 2026-present Janghoon Lee (Redrob) and contributors
Licensed under the MIT License or the Apache License, Version 2.0, at your option.

Upstream's ArtCraft name, wordmark, logo and "A" mark are not part of this distribution: they
were removed as upstream's terms require (UPSTREAM.md).

The Redrob name, logo, tile and product marks (assets/brand/, and everything derived from them
under assets/app-icon/ and assets/app-icons/) are trademarks of Redrob. They are not licensed
under MIT or Apache-2.0; they may be used only to refer to Redrob and its products.

